# Exhaustive Quickshell vs Rust Comparison & Master Implementation Roadmap

This document provides a comprehensive, file-by-file audit of the entire Quickshell project (`/mnt/hdd/config/quickshell/prism (bak)`) compared against the current native Rust workspace (`/mnt/hdd/config/quickshell/prism/crates`). It analyzes all 45 QML modules, 16 services, 27 helper scripts, `shell.qml`, and deployment configs, detailing their internal logic, connected components, current Rust status, exact missing features, and implementation specifications.

