### 2.2 Notification Center & Quick Settings Subsystem

#### Quickshell Architecture
- `modules/NotificationCenter.qml`: Left-docked 400px card, margins: top 10, bottom 10, left 0. `enterAnimation: "slideLeft"`.
- `modules/NcBatteryIndicator.qml`: Header battery icon (18x12 outline with nub, charging lightning bolt, charge bar fill, and percentage text).
- 32x32 circular settings button with hover inversion in header.
- `modules/NcTile.qml`: Top 4 tiles span 360px. When a tab is selected, its width animates from 44px to `expandedWidth` (~216px) over 220ms with `Easing.OutCubic`, revealing title and subtitle. The 3 inactive tiles collapse to 44x44 square icon buttons.
- Sub-Pages:
